I stand corrected.  The hammer Mjollnir, in legend, is portable, but only by
the very strongest of creatures, such as giants, etc.  However, it is
unthrowable by anyone but Thor.

So, here's a suggestion.  Leave Mjollnir the way it is.  If, however, the
owner has 25 strength, make Mjollnir throwable, like a boomerang.  If memory
serves, it seems that throwing Mjollnir created a stroke of lightning...

The war hammer named Mjollnir hits the fire giant! -more-
The bolt of lightning hits the fire giant! -more-
You destroy the fire giant! -more-
The war hammer named Mjollnir returns to your hand.

